#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:49
#: 0cfa1fdae8544e7481d50ab9ea1f077a
msgid "LED connection and configuration"
msgstr "LED连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:51
#: 4e16d299dc7a41f4890fddbce9436156
msgid ""
"The LED cable from each arm should be connected to the PDB's LED ports "
"(highlighted in green below) labelled \"1\" to \"4\" (the order does not "
"matter). The adjacent 6-pin port (highlighted in purple below) should be "
"connected to two of the autopilot's PWM output pins (e.g. AUX OUT 5 and 6)"
msgstr ""
"每个机臂的LED线缆应连接到电源分配板上标记为\"1\"至\"4\"的LED端口（如下方绿色高亮所示，顺序不限）。相邻的6针端口（如下方紫色高亮所示）应连接到飞控的两个PWM输出引脚（例如AUX"
" OUT 5和6）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:58
#: c5880994c91248e1a1b826d995ff6647
msgid ""
"Then set the following parameters on the autopilot, assuming the autopilot's"
" AUX OUT 5 and 6 pins have been connected as shown above"
msgstr "然后在飞控上设置以下参数，假设已按上图将飞控的AUX OUT 5和6引脚连接好"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:60
#: 43a6a080fbb5420a9588fc32f1705443
msgid ":ref:`SERVO13_FUNCTION <SERVO13_FUNCTION>` = 129 (ProfiLED1)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO13_FUNCTION <SERVO13_FUNCTION>` = 129（ProfiLED1）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:61
#: 44359f25faa141cdb8910a64cbcdba61
msgid ":ref:`SERVO14_FUNCTION <SERVO14_FUNCTION>` = 132 (ProfiLEDClock)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO14_FUNCTION <SERVO14_FUNCTION>` = 132（ProfiLEDClock）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:62
#: 439feb4236fd42e5851effa66ca55aef
msgid ":ref:`NTF_LED_LEN <NTF_LED_LEN>` = 8"
msgstr ":ref:`NTF_LED_LEN <NTF_LED_LEN>` = 8"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:63
#: 6449631cf675450eba37f448b2a23037
msgid "Check the :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES <NTF_LED_TYPES>` bit for \"ProfiLED\""
msgstr "勾选 :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES <NTF_LED_TYPES>` 中的\"ProfiLED\"位"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:69
#: f752bb10780d491582ac5bf7358e159a
msgid "Build issues and advice"
msgstr "组装问题与建议"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:71
#: e875bd2123dd4f0e94752947f2ce2671
msgid "Below is a list of issues and recommendations"
msgstr "以下是问题和建议列表"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:73
#: 791a6f1f8aa14fcd863bbd4cbf79a297
msgid ""
"Assembly is difficult because both upper and lower plates are required to "
"hold the legs in place.  Temporarily use four `5cm (2inch) C-clamps "
"<https://www.amazon.com/C-Clamp-Industrial-Strength-Woodworking-"
"Building/dp/B0BLC44XHT>`__ to hold the lower plate and legs together."
msgstr ""
"组装较为困难，因为上下两块板都需要夹住支脚。可临时使用四个 `5cm（2英寸）C型夹 <https://www.amazon.com/C-Clamp-"
"Industrial-Strength-Woodworking-Building/dp/B0BLC44XHT>`__ 将下板和支脚固定在一起。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:74
#: 8900116d893e4f869c1b9a25fc3d7bc1
msgid ""
"The ESC wires are too long resulting in messy wiring.  These can be "
"shortened using `solder sleeves <https://www.amazon.com/TICONN-Connectors-"
"Waterproof-Insulated-Electrical/dp/B07GDDKJ1D>`__"
msgstr ""
"ESC线缆过长导致布线混乱。可使用 `焊接套管 <https://www.amazon.com/TICONN-Connectors-"
"Waterproof-Insulated-Electrical/dp/B07GDDKJ1D>`__ 进行缩短"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:75
#: c1247f9f60ee468cb4de48af53bc52cc
msgid ""
"If a gimbal is to be used, the battery must be mounted on the top of the "
"vehicle.  Two possible configurations are:"
msgstr "如果要使用云台，电池必须安装在飞行器顶部。有两种可能的配置："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:77
#: a9fb59a6ccf54de0a18140428bdf4fec
msgid ""
"Use two smaller batteries mounted on the top of the frame on either side of "
"the autopilot.  Be careful that the two batteries have the same voltage if "
"connected in parallel"
msgstr "在飞控两侧的机架顶部分别安装两块较小的电池。如果并联连接，请确保两块电池电压相同"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:78
#: 0267a4a0887f4a778565ce1b98fb87ab
msgid ""
"Mount the autopilot between the upper and lower plates allowing a single "
"large batter to be mounted on top of the frame.  Note this will make "
"accessing the autopilot difficult"
msgstr "将飞控安装在上下板之间，这样可以将单块大电池安装在机架顶部。注意这样会使访问飞控变得困难"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:80
#: 2e8770366bd64033b615dc1aba15f665
msgid ""
"The 30cm battery straps included in the kit are too short.  Replace with 2cm"
" x 50cm velcro battery straps"
msgstr "套件附带的30cm电池绑带太短。请换用2cm x 50cm的魔术贴电池绑带"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:81
#: 40f8fb688aa34ebcac195b02671f168c
msgid ""
"The PDB has a 12V pin for \"Video Transmitter\" but note the 2-pin JST "
"connector's GND and 12V pins are reversed compared to thes equivalent "
"Herelink power cable"
msgstr "电源分配板有一个用于\"视频发射器\"的12V引脚，但请注意该2针JST接口的GND和12V引脚顺序与对应的Herelink电源线相反"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:88
#: c09e53b776874f1e8d90f977dfa3dc7d
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "视频"
